sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Creator
    participant API as Post API
    participant Blob as Media store
    participant Fan as Fan-out worker
    participant Feed as Feed cache
    participant F as Follower
    C->>Blob: upload media directly
    C->>API: create the post
    API->>Fan: fan out to followers
    alt ordinary account
        Fan->>Feed: push the post id into each follower's feed
        Note over Fan,Feed: fan-out on write — reads become a single cache lookup
    else celebrity with millions of followers
        Fan->>Fan: skip the push
        Note over Fan: fan-out on write would mean millions of writes per post
    end
    F->>Feed: open the app
    Feed-->>F: precomputed feed
    F->>API: merge in the celebrities they follow, pulled at read time
